          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CARA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Nonetheless, the only question that matters now is how do we stop him? And the answer is... I don't know. We may simply be beaten.",
